+      <p class="small">
+        Subsidy regimes materially shift the retail price level and (to a smaller extent) the observed price pass-through. For strict High vs Low subsidy labels,
+        the average petrol price is lower by <b>{_fmt_num(metrics['dampening_high_vs_low']['petrol_usd_liter']['pct_diff_high_vs_low'], 1)}%</b> in High-subsidy observations.
