+        <li><b>Volatility transmission is similar in magnitude</b> across Brent and retail weekly means (weekly % change std ~{_fmt_num(metrics['volatility']['brent_weekly_pct_std']*100,2)}–{_fmt_num(metrics['volatility']['diesel_weekly_pct_std']*100,2)} percentage points), suggesting short-run shocks propagate rapidly in the aggregate.</li>
